  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3211.03 Pounds per Hour and Pounds per Season",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3211.03 Pounds per Hour and Pounds per Season. In addition, the owner or operator of a budget source shall provide the NETS administrator, in the same quarterly reports, and in a format consistent with Env-A 3211.02, NOx emissions in pounds per hour for every hour during the control period and cumulative quarterly and seasonal NOx emission data in pounds.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
